# Build: Peakle Admin Web (`/admin-web`)

**Context:** Standalone admin portal for the Peakle platform, separate from `/organizer-web` (React Native player app at `/src`, organizer portal at `/organizer-web`). Reuses the same Supabase project (same `.env` — `SUPABASE_URL` + anon key). Access control is DB-side via the existing `platform_admins` table and `is_platform_admin()` RPC — gate every query behind it.

**Stack:** Next.js 15, TypeScript, App Router. Mirror `/organizer-web`'s project setup (same deps: Supabase JS, Lucide React, Sonner). Runs on port `3001`.

---

## Theme — match the app exactly, don't invent values

This prompt may be run outside the repo root, so don't assume free browsing — but the source of truth lives in the existing project:

1. **Copy verbatim** the CSS variables / Tailwind tokens from `organizer-web/app/globals.css` and `organizer-web/tailwind.config.ts` (the `peakle-ink`, `peakle-paper`, `peakle-optic` set). Do not redefine or approximate colors — read those two files first and reuse the exact values.
2. Font stack: **General Sans + Satoshi + Space Grotesk** (same imports as organizer-web).
3. Admin-only overrides, layered on top of the copied tokens:
   - Sidebar: always dark, `#0B1613` (deep forest) — ignores the theme toggle.
   - Primary action accent: `peakle-optic` / `#D6E94A`.
   - Status badges: teal = active, brick = warning, red/error = suspended or banned.
4. If `organizer-web`'s files are genuinely unreachable, fall back to points 2–3 and keep everything else neutral dark/light — don't guess brand colors.

---

## Scope — keep it simple, one admin persona

Cut from 6 sections to 4. Use slide-over drawers for record detail instead of dedicated `[id]` routes — same functionality, less routing.

| Route | Contains |
|---|---|
| `/` | Redirect → `/dashboard` |
| `/dashboard` | KPIs (total users, active venues, sessions this month, gross revenue) + one growth chart + recent activity feed. No separate analytics page. |
| `/users` | Searchable table (name, email, join date, rating). Row click → detail drawer (profile, match history, memberships, reports). Ban/unban in drawer. |
| `/venues` | Table + pending-approval tab. Row click → detail drawer (address, courts, organizers, verification_status). Approve / Reject / Suspend with confirm dialog. |
| `/access` | Two tabs, one page: **Entitlements** (organizer plan/tier, grant/revoke) and **Admins** (list `platform_admins`, add by email, remove — can't remove self). |

`app/(admin)/layout.tsx` guards every route: not `isAdmin` → show login screen instead of the shell.

