cd admin-web && npm run build     # must pass with 0 TS errors
```

Manual: `localhost:3001` shows login → non-admin sees "Admin access required" → admin sees dashboard KPIs → Venues approval queue approves and updates `verification_status` in Supabase → Users table search works → Access page lists `platform_admins`.